/-!
# The table of `u_ij`, `0 ≤ i, j ≤ 38` (data for the kernel checks of Lemma 5.3)

Generated by `code/utab/gen_utab.gp`; row `i` packed as `Σ_j u_ij 2^(K j)`. Checked against the recurrence
of `u` in the kernel (`CalegariSlopes.ADB.Proof.rec_ok`), so nothing here is trusted.
-/

